#: dist/js/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js:59
msgid "YTD"
msgstr "Cumul Anual"

#. "Running Totals" are accumulated totals calculated incrementally from the start of a sequence or period. This row label appears in reports with multiple cumulative totals in a single row. The term is plural because it refers to multiple totals.
#: dist/js/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js:60
msgid "Running Totals"
msgstr "Totale cumulative"

